{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>外交部發言人郭嘉昆今（11日）在例行記者會上，被問及APEC峰會期間中日元首會否會晤時表示，「作為2026年APEC東道主，中方積極履行東道主義務，願同各方一道共同推動APEC中國年取得圓滿成功。至於中日關係，中方已多次闡明立場」。（澎湃新聞）</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T08:55:13.803230+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T08:12:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T04:17:34.844303+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T08:48:47.141526+00:00","content_hash":"36408307bbc2ccc89ab8d5b364c1b3d049155dcb16e168639b8d5341a9d5457a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}